  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "p9-gap-elderhood-care.pension-appeal",
      "title": "去养老金局问一次补发",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.085,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 85
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 85
        },
        {
          "key": "official",
          "kind": "official",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 25,
          "maxAge": 65
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "pension-appeal-partial",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把旧工资册摊在柜台上，{official}翻到被划掉的那页，说缺一份厂里证明，答应先补三个月的差额，剩下的要她下月带证明再来。补发的九克朗扣了四十赫勒手续费，她数了两遍才放进布袋。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 9,
              "reason": "补发部分养老金，扣除手续费"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.05,
              "reason": "拿到部分补发，但还有事没办完"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "pension-appeal-partial",
              "text": "楼梯没有扶手，{subject}扶着墙一步步上到二楼，窗口后面的{official}把工资册举到灯下看了很久，用指甲刮了刮被划掉的那行字。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "pension-appeal-partial",
              "text": "她数钱时手指有些抖，九克朗加几枚赫勒，在掌心压出一点分量。{official}已经在叫下一个人，她赶紧把布袋口系紧，退到走廊里。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pension-appeal-two-trips",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "第一次去，窗口说管档案的人不在，让她改天再来。{subject}隔了四天又跑一趟，这回{neighbor}陪她，{official}才收下身份纸和邻居写的证明，说工龄要核，补发的钱月底汇到。她来回走了两趟，鞋底磨薄了一层。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "两趟往返的车钱与手续费"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "reason": "邻居陪她跑了一趟养老金局"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "pension-appeal-two-trips",
              "text": "那天雨夹雪，{subject}在局门口等了半个钟头才开门，管档案的桌子空着，{official}只抬了抬下巴说改天。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "pension-appeal-two-trips",
              "text": "第二次{neighbor}搀着她上楼梯，{official}把那张邻居写的证明翻来覆去看了两遍，才在册子上记下她的名字和门牌号。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pension-appeal-refused",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{official}说那一页工龄没有厂里盖章，无法证明，补发办不了。{subject}把工资册收回布袋，下楼时在拐角歇了一回。回家后{neighbor}帮她把册子又翻了一遍，在一张旧工资条背面找到铅笔写的年份，两人对着灯看了半天。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.08,
              "reason": "补发申请被拒，工龄无法证明"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "reason": "邻居帮她翻找旧工资条"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "pension-appeal-refused",
              "text": "窗口的木板啪地合上，{subject}还站着没动，布袋里的工资册硌着肋骨。她下楼时扶着冰冷的墙，每一级都踩得很实。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "pension-appeal-refused",
              "text": "灯下{neighbor}把工资条举到近前，{subject}眯着眼辨认那行铅笔字，手指顺着纸边摸过去，摸到一道折痕。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "task": {
        "domain": "daily",
        "goals": [
          "survival",
          "rest"
        ],
        "needs": [
          "cash",
          "safety"
        ],
        "baseUtility": 1.15,
        "risk": 0.1,
        "skills": [
          "numeracy"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-gap-elderhood-care.ask-neighbor-repair",
      "title": "请邻居帮忙修一次炉子",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.08,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 85
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 4
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 85
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 60
        },
        {
          "key": "worker",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 60
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "stove-repaired-free",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "楼下在铁工厂干活的{neighbor}傍晚拎着工具上来，蹲在炉前敲敲打打，换了一截铁皮烟道，把炉门铰链紧好。他要走时，{subject}把那锅汤热了端给他，他坐在门槛上喝完，没收一个赫勒。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.06,
              "reason": "炉子修好，不再倒烟呛咳"
            },
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "把一锅汤送给帮忙的邻居"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-repaired-free",
              "text": "{neighbor}的袖口沾着铁屑，他先用手指试了试炉门缝，再从工具袋里摸出一把扳手，一下一下拧紧。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-repaired-free",
              "text": "汤是白菜和一点熏肉皮熬的，{subject}看着他把汤喝净，才想起自己后半夜终于能睡个整觉。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stove-needs-part",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{neighbor}看过炉门，说铰链座子裂了，得换零件，今天先别生火。他第二天从厂里带了一小片铁板回来，锉成座子装上，收了她二十赫勒当材料钱。{subject}当晚把炉子生起来，烟是直的。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -20,
              "reason": "付给邻居的零件材料钱"
            },
            {
              "type": "condition",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "condition": "bronchitis",
              "add": false,
              "reason": "炉子修好后煤烟不再倒灌"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-needs-part",
              "text": "他用手背碰了碰炉门，说这铁皮薄了，关不严。{subject}给他递了杯热水，他喝了一口就下楼去取工具。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-needs-part",
              "text": "二十赫勒是{subject}从手绢里数出来的，{neighbor}接过去揣进兜里，又蹲下把螺丝挨个紧了一遍。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stove-temp-fix",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{neighbor}那几天厂里加班，抽不出空，只教{subject}用湿报纸堵住炉门缝，再用一块砖把烟道口压小。烟确实小了些，但半夜还是呛醒了一回。她没再开口请他，把砖块挪了挪，凑合过这个冬天。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "炉子未修好，仍受煤烟刺激"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "求人未成，只能自己凑合"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-temp-fix",
              "text": "湿报纸贴上去时嗤地冒了一股白汽，{subject}退后看了一会儿，烟果然从砖缝里绕出去了些。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-temp-fix",
              "text": "{neighbor}说等这批活干完就来，{subject}点点头，没再提那锅汤。夜里她起来两回，把压烟道的砖挪来挪去。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "task": {
        "domain": "daily",
        "goals": [
          "rest",
          "care"
        ],
        "needs": [
          "safety",
          "health"
        ],
        "baseUtility": 1.15,
        "risk": 0.1,
        "skills": [
          "social"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-gap-elderhood-care.take-lodger",
      "title": "把空房间租给一个安静的人",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.085,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 85
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 3
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 85
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 35
        },
        {
          "key": "worker",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 60
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "lodger-settled",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{neighbor}带女工{worker}来看房，屋子朝院子，有张铁床和一只洗脸架。她摸了摸窗台，说干净，当场定下，每月六克朗，发薪日先交。{subject}看着她在租约上按下手印，心里松了半口气。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 6,
              "reason": "收到第一个月房租"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "reason": "女工租下空房间"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "lodger-settled",
              "text": "{worker}弯腰看了看床脚，又推了推窗户，铰链响了一声。{neighbor}在门口说这屋子冬天有点冷但干净，她听了就没再还价。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "lodger-settled",
              "text": "租约是{subject}从抽屉里翻出来的旧纸，背面还有字。{worker}用蘸了墨水的手指按下去，留下一个圆圆的印。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lodger-refused-cold",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{worker}看过房间，伸手在墙上贴了一会儿，说太冷，冬天怕是熬不住，便走了。{subject}追到楼梯口说租金可以降到五克朗，对方还是摇头。她回来把窗户缝用纸条塞了塞，没告诉{neighbor}。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "房间没租出去，有些泄气"
            },
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "买纸条塞窗缝的小开销"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "lodger-refused-cold",
              "text": "{worker}把手掌贴在墙上，很快又收回去，说这墙渗寒气。{subject}说铺厚点就行，对方已经转身去看楼梯了。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "lodger-refused-cold",
              "text": "楼梯口的光很暗，{subject}压低声说五克朗也行，{worker}摇了摇头，围巾在脖子上绕了一圈就下楼去了。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lodger-trial",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{neighbor}替{worker}说了几句好话，说她安静、按时上工。{subject}便同意先试住一个月，租金五克朗，水电另算。头一个星期，女工每晚回来都把炉子边的灰扫干净，{subject}看在眼里，没说什么。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 5,
              "reason": "试住一个月的租金"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.07,
              "reason": "邻居为女工担保"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "lodger-trial",
              "text": "{neighbor}站在门口说这姑娘在洗衣房干活，不闹腾。{subject}看了看{worker}的鞋，鞋底是补过的，便点了头。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "lodger-trial",
              "text": "第一个星期，炉子边的灰每天都是干净的，{subject}有时故意早起来看，看见扫帚靠在墙角。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "task": {
        "domain": "daily",
        "goals": [
          "survival",
          "belonging"
        ],
        "needs": [
          "cash",
          "belonging"
        ],
        "baseUtility": 1.2,
        "risk": 0.1,
        "skills": [
          "social"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-gap-elderhood-care.clinic-recheck",
      "title": "去医院复查一次",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.085,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 60,
          "max": 85
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 60,
          "maxAge": 85
        },
        {
          "key": "doctor",
          "kind": "worker",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 30,
          "maxAge": 70,
          "occupation": "Arzt"
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "clinic-cheaper-medicine",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{doctor}听了听她的胸口，把旧处方翻过来，换了一种便宜些的药粉，说少吃盐，别喝浓咖啡。{subject}把嘱咐记在药盒背面，用铅笔头，字写得歪，但看得清。药钱比原来省了三十赫勒。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -2,
              "reason": "挂号与换药的花费"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "复查后换了合适的药"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "clinic-cheaper-medicine",
              "text": "{doctor}把听诊器贴上去时，{subject}屏住气，听见自己心跳在耳朵里响。他挪开听筒，在处方纸上写了几行字。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "clinic-cheaper-medicine",
              "text": "药盒背面被她写得密密麻麻，铅笔头钝了，她就在裤子上蹭一蹭再写。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "clinic-no-ticket",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}天没亮就出门，到医院时队伍已经排到街角。等到中午，号发完了。她在医院门口的石阶上坐了很久，胸口那阵闷劲儿退下去才起身，布袋里的药盒一次没拿出来。回家时买了一个面包，花了四赫勒。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.06,
              "reason": "排了半天没挂上号"
            },
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -4,
              "reason": "往返与一个面包的花费"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "clinic-no-ticket",
              "text": "队伍前面有人靠着墙打盹，{subject}把手缩进袖口里，脚下的石板又冷又硬，她换了好几回坐姿。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "clinic-no-ticket",
              "text": "号发完时窗口挂出一块小牌，{subject}站起来读了半天，才明白今天没指望了。石阶上还留着别人坐过的潮气。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "clinic-neighbor-recheck",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{neighbor}陪她坐电车去医院，替她在队伍里站着。{doctor}看了旧处方，说药量先减一半，下个月再来一趟。{subject}问减一半会不会不管用，{doctor}说先看看，别自己加。回来的电车上她一直捏着那张减量的处方。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.02,
              "reason": "医生调整了药量"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.09,
              "reason": "邻居陪她去医院并替她排队"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "clinic-neighbor-recheck",
              "text": "电车里挤，{neighbor}用胳膊替她挡着人，{subject}把布袋抱在胸前。医院走廊的石灰水味一直跟到门口。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "clinic-neighbor-recheck",
              "text": "{doctor}把药量写在纸上，画了一道横线表示减半。{subject}凑近看了两遍，才把纸折好收进布袋内层。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
